{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>每個人都會有值得紀念的重要日子，Countdown 是一款讓你將這些日子以精美小工具形式展示在主畫面與鎖定畫面的應用程式。無論是婚禮、考試、旅行還是紀念日，它都能讓你時刻期待。目前這款 App 的終生版正在限時免費中，原價 US $14.99。</p>\n\n<h2>多種風格倒數小工具</h2>\n<p>Countdown 提供超過 30 種精心設計的小工具風格，從優雅花卉到簡約現代，應有盡有。支援主畫面與鎖定畫面顯示，可選擇小中大尺寸，完美配合版面配置。活動到期後還能切換至正數模式，追蹤天數，無需註冊即可使用，資料透過 iCloud 自動同步。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1284x2778bb-52-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1284x2778bb-53-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1284x2778bb-54-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1284x2778bb-55-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1284x2778bb-56-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1284x2778bb-57-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>Countdown 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後看到收費牆，Lifetime 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。</p>\n<img alt=\"IMG 4078\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/IMG_4078-473x1024.webp\"/>\n<img alt=\"IMG 4080\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/IMG_4080-473x1024.webp\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Countdown: 倒數日小工具</li>\n<li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-15T22:57:54.816397+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":410,"images":8,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"unknown"}}